    "created_at": "2023-01-14T10:40:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-14T10:44:11Z",
    "body": "Perhaps a stupid question but, you've configured WT to use Fira Code NerdFont? The shell profile isn't overriding default appearance settings?\r\n\r\nSpecifically, which of the Fira Code NerdFont files did you install? I've had the best results with installing just one font weight, and installing both the Windows compatible and non-Windows compatible versions. I haven't installed any of the Monospace versions\r\n\r\nI've generally had the best results installing both the Windows compatible and non-Windows compatible versions of just one font weight, non-Monospace (so 'Fira Code Retina Nerd Font Complete Windows Compatible.ttf'\r\nand 'Fira Code Retina Nerd Font Complete.ttf'). In my experience, they both work equally well in WT, and are working for me after applying the same preset.\r\n\r\n![powershell starship](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18666361/212468155-8b1f617f-40b4-4e59-bd15-dee430d3a257.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
