    "updated_at": "2023-01-14T17:56:54Z",
    "body": "I would have expected the output to luck differently in the absence of a nerd font. \r\n\r\nI still assume there is an encoding issue somewhere. Try running `$OutputEncoding = [Console]::InputEncoding = [Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8` and regenerate the file again if necessary to force the shell to use UTF-8.",
