    "updated_at": "2023-02-22T19:03:03Z",
    "body": "> I would have expected the output to luck differently in the absence of a nerd font.\r\n> \r\n> I still assume there is an encoding issue somewhere. Try running `$OutputEncoding = [Console]::InputEncoding = [Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8` and regenerate the file again if necessary to force the shell to use UTF-8.\r\n\r\nThis also worked for me and am just putting this in my $PROFILE",
